d5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380022 #edb/ref 1074 "To find the intersection of the hyperboloid and the plane $y=4$, we substitute $y=4$ into the equation of the hyperboloid:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{20}+\\frac{(4-2)^{2}}{16}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{80} & =-1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{20}+\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{80} & =-1 \\\\ \\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{20}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{80} & =-1-\\frac{1}{4} \\\\ \\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{20}-\\frac{{z}^{2}}{80} & =-\\frac{5}{4} \\\\ -\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{25}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{100} & =1 \\\\ -\\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{{5}^{2}}+\\frac{{z}^{2}}{{10}^{2}} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of a hyperbola with semi-axes of lengths $10$ and $5.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380023 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186380024 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380023 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186380025 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380023 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186380026 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380023 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186380027 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380023 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186380028 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380023 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380023 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380023 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186380028 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380023 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "0907267b-b9e7-57b7-9485-3ee41b06f7d4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380024 #edb/ref 1080 "$4$ and $5$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380024 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380024 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8e06071b-7f63-5370-9aa4-6e3d2ae0f7f7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380025 #edb/ref 1080 "$2\\sqrt{5}$ and $4\\sqrt{5}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380025 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380025 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "ceefef73-e49d-5607-b222-3ee1c5ed4b12" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186380026 #edb/ref 1080 "$10$ and $4$" #e